summary.label:
LunarCalc is an application that perform lunar calculation for a selected date ( between 1900 and 2200), shows it physicals and orbital’ characteristics and astronomic data:

Moon phase on the selected date;
Apogee and Perigee closest date to selected date;
Distance from the Earth;
Position (latitude and longitude) related to ecliptic;
Zodiacal position;
Date of passing thru the ascending node;
Date of passing thru the descending node;

Developed for iPhone with iOS 17 or higher.

Avaliable in Portughese, Spanish, Italian, French, English, German, Japanese and Russian.
